{
  "title": "Flows",
  "page": "flows.html",
  "summary": "Animated sequences from need to accepted change.",
  "five": "A flow is an ordered sequence, not a project plan. The dot moves when motion is allowed. On a phone, or with reduced motion, it stays still. The order of the steps is the lesson.",
  "example": [
    "Prepare, talk, send notes, edit from the reply, then baseline. Skipping the reply makes the notes yours alone."
